{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000022"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000022"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000023"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000024"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000025"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000026"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000027"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000028"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000029"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Y"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000021","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-03"}
{"body":{"matters":"the price of coherence, paid in sameness","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000023"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000026"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002T"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"}],"prose":"Many self-governing parts are asked to act as one, and the paper tries this again and again: through shared meaning, through values given bodies, through a coordinator, and through rehearsal. Each attempt pays for coherence with some loss of each part's own shape, and pays differently.","title":"Holding together without making alike"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000022","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether joining demands structural change","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000024"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000025"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"}],"prose":"The starting lack is wholes that cannot work with other wholes unless someone changes their structure. The idea of the nested part arrives with a history and with a list of what lone autonomy fails at.","title":"A gap where joining means rebuilding"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000023","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which ground the idea has been carried into","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"}],"prose":"From a philosopher's double-faced entity to factory cells, power grids, building sites and data pipelines, the same figure of part-and-whole keeps being moved into new ground.","title":"The nested part travels"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000024","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which shortfall is being named","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"}],"prose":"Systems that decide by themselves break when conditions shift, inherit skewed judgement, cannot answer for harm, and see too little of their surroundings; twins and learning are offered as the missing feed.","title":"What autonomy alone gets wrong"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000025","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which plane carries the binding","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000027"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002B"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002G"}],"prose":"Coherence is sought on three planes at once: what things mean between parts, what a decision must respect, and who has the last word. The planes lean on each other.","title":"Three planes of holding together"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000026","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where agreement about meaning lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000028"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000029"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002A"}],"prose":"Agreement on what data means can be imposed from a shared model or worked out at the moment two parts meet; the paper sides with the second and gives parts an interior able to interpret.","title":"Meaning made between, not above"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000027","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much representation must be shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Everyone adopts one format, everyone maps to a common layer, or each pair translates as needed with nothing shared; the last keeps parts free but asks most of the moment of contact.","title":"Three ways to agree"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000028","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a semantic contract lives","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A vocabulary built for one exchange, one episode, one task phase, then dropped or revised; a contract of sense with a lifetime.","title":"Meaning that expires"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000029","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a part can read what reaches it","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Some parts are given ontologies and reasoning so they can turn mixed, noisy input into a picture of the situation before deciding.","title":"A part that can interpret"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which quality is given a body of its own","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002E"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002F"}],"prose":"Fairness, ethics, a long view and watchfulness are not left as properties of the whole; each becomes a kind of part with its own job, and the parts feed one another.","title":"Values given bodies"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision must not violate","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased parts stand beside decisions as checks, encoding rules, harm limits and known patterns of skew, and auditing outcomes in loans, hiring, vehicles and triage.","title":"Guards on a decision"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon a goal is judged over","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Getting a goal done cheaply is set against getting it done well over time; the difference is carried by weighing many criteria and by measures that are still to be invented.","title":"The longer horizon"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002D","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment of local knowledge with global state","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100057F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"}],"prose":"Parts that know their own corner can still be wrong together; watchful parts spread awareness of the whole state across levels so local choices line up.","title":"Shared watchfulness"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between kinds of part","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"The value-bearing parts form a small economy: guards pass verdicts to the long-view part, interpreters supply context, watchers span every level, and conflicts among them go up to be negotiated.","title":"How the organs feed one another"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where the final say actually sits","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002N"}],"prose":"A dedicated part binds the rest while promising to leave their insides alone; yet the same part is named the top with the highest say, and its watchers are called orchestrators.","title":"The coordinator that says it does not rule"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of each part's inside stays untouched","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006T6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"}],"prose":"Joining is negotiated at runtime so each part keeps its own logic, models and scope; the coordinator works at the level of meaning and organisation and leaves the wires to others.","title":"Federation as untouched interiors"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which function is handed to which component","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007R8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"The binding part is itself a small whole: a deciding orchestrator, a graph of what can connect to what, a translator, a finder, a planner of workflows and their runner, with language models suggested for the first and third.","title":"The coordinator's own organs"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"rank within the nesting","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"}],"prose":"Despite distributed authority, rank reappears: the top sets directives, the coordinator is superholon with the highest say, and the simulation's manager answers upward to it.","title":"The pyramid returns"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"cost of mediation as parts multiply","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"}],"prose":"Translating and reasoning at every meeting slows with numbers, needs agreed protocols nobody yet has, and carries sensitive traffic that must be guarded and recorded.","title":"What mediation costs as it grows"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002M","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether order is designed or arises","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Alongside the designed top runs the older thought that whole-scale order can arise from local interaction with no one in charge.","title":"Pattern from below"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002N","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the simulated also directs","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002S"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned around: the parts being simulated also steer the run, and the live system is mirrored in a federation of stand-ins that check its answers.","title":"Parts that rehearse themselves"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002P","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited from the agent tradition","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"}],"prose":"The ways agents are simulated, help simulation and watch over it are carried over wholesale to holons, which add nesting to agents' autonomy.","title":"Inherited from agents"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002Q","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of influence over the run","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"}],"prose":"From parts that only supply data, through ones that react and learn, to ones that rewrite the run's rules and goals.","title":"Grades of steering"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between a stand-in and its holon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"Each holon gets a federate twin on a shared runtime; a manager twin answers to the coordinator, discrepancies are flagged upward and invalidate results, and time management keeps the doubles in step.","title":"The federation's double"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002S","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who is left without a way to move","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200002X"}],"prose":"Everything above is cast onto sparse rural transport, where the thing to be found is often an absence.","title":"One countryside as the trying ground"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002T","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"locating gaps rather than serving demand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"}],"prose":"Beyond routing trips, the system is asked to locate places with no means of travel, by noticing where requests fail and which zones people avoid.","title":"Finding absence"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002V","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which dimension each actor wears","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009Z9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"}],"prose":"Concrete actors put on the abstract dimensions: travellers as interpreters, transport services as fair and far-sighted, infrastructure as watchers, a communication part as translator, the coordinator as orchestrator.","title":"Casting the roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002W","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the claimed standing of the evidence","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"The case is offered as an illustration of fit, with no measurement yet, and the whole framework is called a set of analytical roles rather than an implementation.","title":"Showing rather than proving"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002X","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where the written form departs from its own claims","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"}],"prose":"In a few places the written form slips: the long-view section repeats the ethics examples word for word, two barrier descriptions trade places, and a bullet strays into another section or stands empty.","title":"Where the text folds on itself"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200002Y","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}